  "model_marker_semantics": [
    "filterResponse resets the model marker to null under Lonf.e()/Lone.close protection before attempting filtering; category/disabled and failed attempts leave it null.",
    "After successful strict filtering, filterResponse commits the returned response object itself as model.hiroStrictSearchResponse under the same model-write-lock protocol. Identity, not query text or equality, ties the marker to its response.",
    "reconcileModel does not acquire locks: it runs only in avdv.O's accepted merge branch, under the existing receiver write and incoming read locks.",
    "When incoming.S == incoming.hiroStrictSearchResponse and the marker is non-null, reconcileModel clears receiver.ag and assigns receiver.hiroStrictSearchResponse = receiver.S.",
    "No marker is static or serialized; each model tracks its own accepted response snapshot."
  ]
